  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">St. Lucia Enhancing Public Service Performance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Contribute to strengthening the capacity of the Ministry of Finance and the Ministry of the Public Service to tackle three crucial and closely interrelated items for improving public service performance in St. Lucia: (i) At the aggregate level, to manage a sustainable wage bill during difficult times and increased pressures for public employment; (ii) At the agency level, to enhance performance and productivity by increasing decentralization of human resources management; and (iii) At the individual level, to implement an effective performance appraisal system with the objective of improving individual performance of public officers.  The objective of the proposed  IDF is to l strengthen the capacity of the Ministry of Finance and the Ministry of the Public Service to tackle two crucial and closely interrelated challenges to improved public service performance in St. Lucia:  (i)	At the aggregate level, to manage a sustainable wage bill during times of fiscal stress and increased pressures for public employment;  (ii)	At the agency level, to enhance performance and productivity by decentralizing some aspects of human resources management and strengthening the performance appraisal system.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
